        "original_id": "f17b97c5-64fa-5658-9ab6-8f17b7cf55b6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sophia Petrillo, Bea Arthur, Estelle Getty\n- Roles: Dorothy Zbornak\n- TV Shows: The Golden Girls, The Golden Palace, Empty Nest\n- Awards: Emmy Award, Golden Globe Award\n\nFacts:\n- Bea Arthur was born as Bernice Frankel on May 13, 1922, and she was an American actress, comedian, singer, and animal rights activist.\n- From 1985 to 1992, Estelle Getty was best known for playing Sophia Petrillo on The Golden Girls, and that role won her an Emmy Award and a Golden Globe Award.\n- On The Golden Girls, Bea Arthur played Dorothy Zbornak, who was Sophia Petrillo's daughter.\n- In real life, Bea Arthur was one year older than Estelle Getty.\n- From 1992 to 1993, Estelle Getty played Sophia Petrillo on The Golden Palace.\n- From 1993 to 1995, Estelle Getty played Sophia Petrillo on Empty Nest.",
